## The mirror test: the only KPI here

Unlike Part 2.0 (which has measurable KPIs) or the Hair folder's retention metrics (T:V ratio, density, shaft diameter), the cut is judged in the mirror against intent. The single KPI is:

> [!check] The 7-day mirror test
> Does the cut **fall correctly on day 7**, when you have stopped using any product, after a normal shower, with no styling, in roughly the shape you asked for?
>
> - **Yes:** the cut works with your biomechanics. Repeat with the same barber, same instructions.
> - **No, but it works with heavy product on day 1:** the cut is fighting your biology. Get it adjusted, or change the silhouette.

A cut that only looks right with 10 minutes of styling daily is a cut you will fail to maintain.

